@startuml
title Current Provider-Owned Plugin Pipeline
participant PluginExecutionCoordinator as Coordinator
participant PluginRunAudit as Audit
participant ReflectionPluginFactory as Factory
participant "Plugin Initialise" as Initialise
participant "Extract" as Extract
participant "Transform / Validate" as Transform
participant "Load Repository" as Load
participant "Finalise" as Finalise

Coordinator -> Audit : started(runId) [write run]
Coordinator -> Factory : create(resolved plugin)
Factory --> Coordinator : fresh plugin instance
Coordinator -> Initialise : execute(context)
Initialise -> Extract : acquire or discover source
Extract --> Initialise : raw source / extracted statements
Initialise -> Transform : parse, map and validate
Transform --> Initialise : typed records
alt dry run
  Initialise -> Load : calculate read/skipped metrics only
  Load --> Initialise : metrics without database write
else write run
  Initialise -> Load : persist(records, runId)
  Load --> Initialise : inserted/updated/skipped
end
Initialise -> Finalise : cleanup/archive/report(completed flag)
Finalise --> Initialise : complete
Initialise --> Coordinator : PluginMetrics
Coordinator -> Audit : completed(result) [write run]
@enduml
